00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:30.450
it's almost like I'm looking at Lamin

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.270
and I will know where Lamin is

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:35.340
because Lamin is invisible normally.

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:38.800
